created: undefined, last updated: 2025-03-25, [Read more](https://srvx.unjs.io/guide/options)

When starting a new server, in addition to main
`fetch` handler, you can provide additional options to customize listening server.
```
import { serve } from "srvx";
serve({
// Generic options
port: 3000,
hostname: "localhost",
// Runtime specific options
node: {},
bun: {},
deno: {},
// Main server handler
fetch: () => new Response("👋 Hello there!"),
});
```
